title: Day8_Zeus_Intro
tags:
---
<<Scene new_dining_area>>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
<<Act "Zeus" "Zeus 3_4s" right bottom #bf9000>>
<<PlayMusic Zeus_Theme>>

//JINGLE
Zeus: Aelius!
Aelius: [Positive] King Zeus, hello!
Zeus: Just Zeus.

-> Of course. Zeus. (deference)
    <<AddZeusAffinity 2>>
-> Does that mean we're friends? (humor)
    <<Add AddZeusAffinity 1>>
    Zeus: ...
    Zeus: Silence.
-> Why. (aggressive)
    <<AddZeusAffinity 1>>
    Zeus: Because!
    Zeus: That is my name!
    Aelius: Okay, dude.

Zeus: Ahem! As I was saying.
Zeus: I’ve invited my wife to have breakfast with me.
Aelius: [Positive] Oh, Hera?
Zeus: Yes! Have you met?

-> Yes, she's lovely. (deference)
    <<AddZeusAffinity 3>>
    Zeus: She is, isn’t she? The light of my life, that woman.
-> Yeah, we hung out for a bit. (humor)
    Zeus: What does that mean?
    Aelius: She ordered some food. We talked. It was chill.
    Zeus: I don’t appreciate how you say these things so lightly.
    Aelius: My bad.
-> Didn’t she throw Hephaestus off a mountain? (aggressive)
    Zeus: ...
    Zeus: Well, yes.
    Zeus: But she went back for him!
    Zeus: And, regardless, that was a <i>very</i> long time ago.
    Aelius: Everything is “a long time ago” with ancient gods.
    Zeus: I don’t appreciate your tone, Aelius.
    Aelius: Suck it up, buttercup.
    Zeus: ...
    Zeus: I am trying very hard not to smite you right now.

Zeus: Ahem. Regardless.
Zeus: Would you be able to bring us some <b>Nectar</b>?
Aelius: Of course.

// Nectar
<<StartCooking "Nectar3">>
<<AddZeusAffinity 2>>
<<Hide Aelius>>
<<Hide Hera>>
<<Hide Zeus>>
===
title: Day8_Zeus_ReturnFancy
tags:
---
<<Scene new_dining_area>>
<<Act "Zeus" "Zeus 3_4s" right bottom #bf9000>>
<<Act "Hera" "Hera" "left" "bottom" #008B8B>>
<<PlayMusic Zeus_Theme>>
<<AddZeusAffinity 2>>
Hera: It's good to hear Ares is doing well.
Zeus: Yes. A shame about him and Hephaestus, though.
Hera: Oh, haven’t you heard? They’re working things out, dear.
Zeus: Really? That's fantastic news!
<<Hide Hera>>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
Aelius: Your Nectar.
<<Hide Aelius>>
<<Act "Hera" "Hera" "left" "bottom" #008B8B>>
Hera: Ah, thank you.
Zeus: It looks wonderful...
Zeus: Thank you.
Hera: Zeus!
Zeus: What is it, my beloved?
Hera: Are you thanking people, now?
<<SyncAffinity>>

<<if $zeusAffinity >= 28>>
    Zeus: Oh, yes. Yes! Aelius has been quite the positive influence.
    Hera: I'll say.
<<elseif $zeusAffinity >= 19>>
    Zeus: Ah… I suppose the mortal has had a positive effect on me.
    Hera: I'll say.
<<else>>
    Zeus: What are you talking about?
    Hera: Aelius must be rubbing off on you.
    Zeus: I don’t know about that…
<<endif>>

-> He did most of the work. (deference)
    <<AddZeusAffinity 2>>
    <<Hide Hera>>
    <<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
    Aelius: He’s really been trying lately.
    <<Hide Aelius>>
    <<Act "Hera" "Hera" "left" "bottom" #008B8B>>
    Hera: Well, I appreciate you helping him along, regaardless.
    <<Hide Hera>>
-> Yeah, I'm pretty great. (humor)
    <<AddZeusAffinity 1>>
    Hera: You… certainly are something.
    Zeus: Annoying, but effective.
    <<Hide Hera>>
    <<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
    Aelius: Rude...
    <<Hide Aelius>>
-> He's still got a LONG way to go. (aggressive)
    Hera: Oh, are you putting him on a regimen?
    Zeus: I don't like where this is going.
    Hera: I've always thought he might benefit from more long-term <i>help.</i>
    Hera: He never would go to couples therapy with me-
    Zeus: <i>AHEM.</i>
    Zeus: Were you saying something, Aelius?
    <<Hide Hera>>
    <<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
    Aelius: Not a thing.
    <<Hide Aelius>>

<<Act "Hera" "Hera" "left" "bottom" #008B8B>>
Zeus: WELL!
Zeus: This has been WONFERFUL!
Zeus: Hera, would you mind giving me a moment with Aelius? I have something to speak at them about.
<<Hide Hera>>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
Aelius: You do?
<<Hide Aelius>>
<<Act "Hera" "Hera" "left" "bottom" #008B8B>>
Hera: I haven’t even had a sip, darling-
Zeus: Here! Take some to go! Thank you, my dearest!
Hera: ...Alright.
Hera: Thank you for the Nectar, Aelius.
<<Hide Hera>>
<<Act "Aelius" "Aelius 3_4s" "left" "bottom" #674ea7>>
-> Are you alright? (deference)
-> What's up? (humor)
-> That wasn't very nice. (aggressive)
    Zeus: What?
    Aelius: You just kicked Hera out before she could eat.
    Zeus: Oh. That. She's fine.
    Aelius: ...

Zeus: Aelius, I wanted to say…
Zeus: Oh… Oh, this Nectar is…

Zeus: Calming. Atmospheric, even.
Aelius: Good to hear.
Zeus: Yes...
Zeus: What I meant to say is, you’re a good listener and confidant.
Zeus: I appreciate all you’ve done for me. And my family.
Zeus: Thank you.


-> No, thank you. (deference)
    <<AddZeusAffinity 2>>
    Aelius: My time here has been defined by the people I met.
    Aelius: And that includes you.
    Zeus: Ah... that is...
    Aelius: Don't cry.
    Zeus: What!
    Zeus: I wasn't!
    Zeus: ...
-> You're too sweet. (humor)
    <<AddZeusAffinity 1>>
    Zeus: Sometimes you remind me far too much of Hermes.
    Aelius: That guy rules.
    Zeus: Okay.
-> Whatever. (aggressive)
    <<AddZeusAffinity 1>>
    Zeus: ...
    Zeus: Okay. Well.

Zeus: I should be off.
<<SyncAffinity>>

<<if $zeusAffinity >= 28>>
    Zeus: But I mean it, Aelius. All of it.
    Zeus: It means a lot.
    Zeus:  You know… I struggle to imagine how we would be getting on without you.
    Aelius: Thank you, Zeus.
    Aelius: I’m glad Hestia brought me here.
    Zeus: Farewell.
    Aelius: Bye!
<<elseif $zeusAffinity >= 19>>
    Zeus: Thank you for the food. And... the other stuff.
<<else>>
    Zeus: Thank you for the food.
<<endif>>

Aelius: Tell Hera I said thanks for coming by!
Zeus: Yes, I will.
<<HideAll>>
<<StopMuzic 0.35>>
<<jump Day8_Hephaestus_Intro>>
===
